{"id": "1890446", "name": "אינטגרל מוכלל עד ∞ – 1/(x·lnᵖ(bx)): התכנסות וערך", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle \\int_{{{CT:0}}}^{\\infty} {{CT:1}}\\,dx\\)</p></div><p>קבעו האם האינטגרל מתכנס, ואם כן חשבו אותו.</p><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px\">א׳</span></div><p>האם האינטגרל מתכנס?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px\">ב׳</span></div><p>אם האינטגרל מתכנס, חשבו את ערכו. אם הוא מתבדר, כתבו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle 0\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מציבים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t=\\ln({{CT:2}}x)\\)</span> ומקבלים אינטגרל חזקה, שאותו כותבים כגבול ובודקים אם הוא סופי.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הצבה</b><br>מציבים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t=\\ln\\left({{CT:2}}x\\right)\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(dt=\\frac{dx}{x}\\)</span>. כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x={{CT:0}}\\)</span> מתקבל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t={{CT:3}}\\)</span>, וכאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\to\\infty\\)</span> גם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t\\to\\infty\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int_{{{CT:0}}}^{\\infty} {{CT:1}}\\,dx=\\int_{{{CT:3}}}^{\\infty} {{CT:4}}\\,dt=\\lim_{R\\to\\infty}\\int_{{{CT:3}}}^{R} {{CT:4}}\\,dt \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — פונקציה קדומה</b><br>עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t^{-{{CT:5}}}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ G(t)={{CT:6}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — הגבול</b><br>זהו אינטגרל מסוג <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\int^\\infty t^{-p}\\,dt\\)</span>, המתכנס אם ורק אם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p&gt;1\\)</span>. כאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p={{CT:5}}\\)</span>, ואכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(G(R)\\to {{CT:7}}\\)</span> כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(R\\to\\infty\\)</span>.[[if test=\"{{CT:9}}\"]] לכן האינטגרל מתכנס:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ I=\\lim_{R\\to\\infty}\\left(G(R)-G({{CT:3}})\\right)=-G({{CT:3}})={{CT:8}} \\]</p>[[else]] הגבול אינו סופי, ולכן <b>האינטגרל מתבדר</b> (ובסעיף ב׳ כותבים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(0\\)</span>).[[/if]]</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:prt1]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "boolean", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 30, "insertstars": 5, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "תשובה מדויקת", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "correct: if (converge and ans1 and is(equal(ans2,value))) or ((not converge) and (not ans1) and is(equal(ans2,0))) then true else false;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "correct", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["Gt", "LG", "b", "converge", "den", "f", "lo", "p", "shift", "t0", "value"], "nvariants": 50}